              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "гипс (gips) — \"a plaster cast; plaster\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Шесть недель он ходил с рукой в гипсе. Shest nedél on khodíl s rukóy v gípse. He went about with his arm in plaster for six weeks."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine. В гипсе — in plaster."
            }
          ]
        },
